  "reason": "Existing evidence shows that models with scvi_n200 RNA encoder and imagenet_vit_l image encoder (e.g., config_029) achieve the highest accuracy. This experiment tests whether replacing the RNA encoder with scgpt (a different representation) while keeping the image encoder and aggregation/fusion settings the same isolates the impact of RNA encoder choice. It addresses uncertainty about whether scgpt could outperform scvi_n200 in this context, a key design decision with potential to influence performance."
